WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.120
They may not want
a serious relationship.

00:00:02.220 --> 00:00:04.700
Which cards can suggest
a lack of serious intentions,

00:00:04.700 --> 00:00:07.600
or a connection that lasts
only a date or two?

00:00:07.900 --> 00:00:10.550
First, the Fool: it points to
a lack of commitment.

00:00:10.550 --> 00:00:12.350
It can end as quickly
as it began.

00:00:12.500 --> 00:00:15.700
They don’t know what they want
or why they want this relationship.

00:00:16.000 --> 00:00:17.600
Next is the Knight of Wands.

00:00:17.600 --> 00:00:19.800
There’s strong attraction,
but no stability.

00:00:20.000 --> 00:00:23.650
They can lose interest
as quickly as they catch fire.

00:00:23.850 --> 00:00:25.000
Next: the Seven of Cups.

00:00:25.000 --> 00:00:26.900
Lots of fantasies and illusions.

00:00:26.900 --> 00:00:28.800
You may not be
their only option.

00:00:29.000 --> 00:00:32.750
The Two of Pentacles can also
suggest a lack of commitment.

00:00:33.000 --> 00:00:34.500
They’re juggling two options.

00:00:34.500 --> 00:00:36.800
There may even be
a secret wife or lover.

00:00:37.000 --> 00:00:38.900
The Devil also represents
a casual relationship.

00:00:39.000 --> 00:00:40.050
Sex, drugs, rock ’n’ roll.

00:00:40.050 --> 00:00:42.700
Passion and chemistry are there,
but no serious intentions.

00:00:42.750 --> 00:00:45.750
The final card is
the Knight of Cups.

00:00:45.850 --> 00:00:48.050
They’ll charm you
and say all the right things,

00:00:48.050 --> 00:00:50.730
but none of it leads anywhere.
